      "value": "@{5c540514d859d512a8d1d2f9|full_name}: To clarify what the issue is, the first three or maybe all four instances are almost full. We are talking space for one user or maybe two if youre lucky. Thats great if you are by yourself. In a group or with a friend or two you are out of luck ever successfully getting into a popular public world together. So you either start your own instance with a group or you are stuck joining a full instance by yourself.",
