  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Somewhere last year, the instance lists were changed. Instead of being able to see any given instance, you can now only see the top 4 instances, and then one seemingly random one.\n\nCan we please get some more quantity *and* more variety in the instance list? If 4 friends and I want to migrate to another instance by portal, this is almost impossible, because the game will only show me instances that are almost full. I liked the old system much better.",
